{"v":4,"catch":"每個喜歡挖掘的人的最佳遊戲！","desc":"被詛咒的島嶼是一個人試圖離開充滿神秘恐怖和難以想像的怪物的島嶼的故事。 為了完成這項任務，他必須用他可靠的鎬子穿過島嶼。\n\n詛咒島將一些流行遊戲的元素與懷舊的像素藝術圖形融合在一起。 我們敢說，這款遊戲是一種獨特的遊戲體驗，將幫助您享受以探索、挖掘和戰鬥神獸為重點的慢節奏遊戲。","publisher":"ESDigital Games","release":"2022-07-07","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/23540518421ed7dc1f913d06fd512725d3cb2be0033922d08616ceb581e9dabd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d21c58beba956cc986e969c81bf480f40e8b2995c4770eec56cbd1c3757ff9f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cf9c31d1c7167529393ce62978c6584e25ca418c32f209cffd1b22d27422847.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c5d931e23ad23b8bdb127cfd422cf26ca269b20f40b107586d1de34f5f794f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b98ec3bc615357c512b585d49dbc816ebe2c93860ebbf922839185d9395776b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31f2aae7be5e7821925f2f8999c90f6ac9bc16e2aa6e5c55711516178ff46a3e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100700018868000","dlc":[]}